   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GomSpace-Market Analysis for Gathering ADS-B information about Commercial airline identiication</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GomSpace-Market Analysis for Gathering ADS-B information about Commercial airline identification.

The main objectives are:
&#xbf;	to send up 4 satellites in orbit around equator to collect the information about Airtraffic over African countries. 
&#xbf;	To enter agreements with African countries or/and ASCENA use the information about the identification, the position and speed of the commercial airlines&#xb4; airplane, real-time and historical data, to charge for going through the respective countries national airspace.
&#xbf;	To set up a company in Ghana or the best suited ASCENA country to collect and distribute the data from the satellites.</narrative>
  </description>
